      "name": "Keto Meat Lover Pizza Cups [The Perfect Snack]",
      "description": "I love to make these keto pizza cups when I have family/friends over for football games or gatherings. I use to feel like I was always in the kitchen making these, so from now on I just make too many batches of these so I can satisfy their cravings and enjoy the games too!\n\nThese pizza cups are packed with Italian sausage, tomato sauce, mozzarella cheese, and bacon crumbles then complete with a slice of ham that holds all these ingredients together.\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n12 slice deli-sliced black forest ham\n16 ounce ground mild Italian sausage\n12 tablespoon low-carb tomato sauce\n3 cup fresh mozzarella cheese\n6 slice cooked bacon\n2 tablespoon basil\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 12 servings of Keto Meat Lovers Pizza Cups. Each serving comes out to be 278 calories, 20.4g fat, 3.3g net carbs, and 19.8g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
